# akantu-rs probe-local patch (UD-409): compile fixes ONLY for upstream's
# MeshSphereIntersector (src/geometry/mesh_sphere_intersector_tmpl.hh at
# 35a8517), which does not compile in Akantu 5 (raw pointers assigned to
# std::unique_ptr members, Array<UInt> for an Array<Int> member, delete of
# unique_ptr members, Eigen VectorXd(Index, double) constructor). No semantic
# change. Applied by oracle/probes/geometry/run-in-container.sh to a COPY of
# the header next to the probe; the reference checkout and the installed
# oracle library are not modified (the class is header-only).
--- a/src/geometry/mesh_sphere_intersector_tmpl.hh
